  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>With an incantation, you call on fel or Void magic to transform yourself and take on demonic features. You gain one of the following benefits of your choice until the spell ends.</p><p><strong>Devourer.</strong> When you roll damage for a spell, weapon, or feature that deals Force damage, you can treat any 1 or 2 on a damage die as a 3.</p><p><strong>Havoc.</strong> Whenever you hit a creature with an attack roll using a Melee weapon, the target takes an extra 1d6 Fire damage.</p><p><strong>Vengeance.</strong> You have a +2 bonus to AC, and your Hit Point maximum and current Hit Points increase by 5 for the duration.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-H5xWhKyjE5oTsBH4\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Devourer’s damage dice are adjusted by hand. Vengeance raises your Hit Point maximum by 5: also add 5 to your current Hit Points.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
